    "body": "I realize this is old text, but it is hard to parse, and we might as well fix it up while we're here.  Maybe try something like:\r\n\r\n```\r\nThe `hip`.VSTIP bit, in response to timer interrupts generated by `vstimecmp`, is set by writing `vstimecmp` with a value that is less than or equal to the sum of `time` and `htimedelta`, truncated to 64 bits; it is cleared by writing `vstimecmp` with a greater value.\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:54:36Z",
